.TH "INSPEKT\-INSPECTED" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-inspected \- Get information about the currently inspected
element.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]inspected\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
\f[I]SUBCOMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]ARGS\f[R]]\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Get information about the currently inspected element.
.PP
Shows details about the element from DevTools inspection or from
`inspekt inspect'.
.PP
To capture element from DevTools: 1.
Right\-click element → Inspect 2.
In DevTools Console: inspektStore() 3.
Run: inspekt inspected
.PP
Or select programmatically: inspekt inspect \(lqh1\(rq inspekt inspected
.PP
Subcommands: inspekt inspected html Get element as HTML inspekt
inspected markdown Get element as Markdown inspekt inspected text Get
element text content inspekt inspected css Get computed CSS styles as
nested CSS
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enjson\f[R]
